  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sudan Regional Crisis 2023-2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The outbreak of fighting in Sudan on 15 April 2023 has severely affected the humanitarian situation in South Sudan. As of 14 August 2023, a total of 220,000 individuals have crossed the border into South Sudan, the majority entering through the Wunthow border point in Upper Nile, seeking safety. Through this project, IOM proposes to continue the provision of onward transportation assistance from border points to transit centers, and onward to final destinations of returnee&#x2019;s choice.</narrative>
  </description>
